# Multi-Tenant SaaS WhatsApp AI Sales Agent — Implementation Plan

Tutaboresha mfumo huu kutoka kwa ajili ya **mfanyabiashara mmoja tu** kuwa **Jukwaa la SaaS (Multi-Tenant)**. Hii itaruhusu wafanyabiashara wengi kujisajili, kuingia (login), kusimamia bidhaa zao wenyewe, na kila mmoja kuunganisha namba yake ya WhatsApp kipekee.

---

## 🏛️ Ramani ya Usanifu Mpya (New SaaS Architecture)

```mermaid
graph TD
    UserA[Merchant A] -->|Login/Manage| Dashboard[Auth Dashboard]
    UserB[Merchant B] -->|Login/Manage| Dashboard
    
    Dashboard -->|JWT Token| REST_API[Express Multi-Tenant Router]
    
    REST_API -->|merchantId| Prisma[Prisma DB client]
    Prisma -->|Separate schemas| SQLite[(dev.db)]
    
    REST_API -->|Dynamic session check| WA_Manager[WhatsApp Multi-Session Manager]
    WA_Manager -->|Session A| Baileys_A[Baileys Connection A - Phone A]
    WA_Manager -->|Session B| Baileys_B[Baileys Connection B - Phone B]
```

