### 4. 🔗 Route Isolation (REST API Updates)

#### [MODIFY] [src/routes/api.js](file:///c:/Users/Aziry Tech/Desktop/whatsapp-ai-sales-agent/src/routes/api.js) + [src/routes/insights.js](file:///c:/Users/Aziry Tech/Desktop/whatsapp-ai-sales-agent/src/routes/insights.js)
Tutafunga endpoints zote na `authMiddleware`.
Kila query ya Prisma itachuja kwa kutumia `req.merchantId`. Mfano:
- `prisma.product.findMany({ where: { merchantId: req.merchantId } })`
- `prisma.order.findMany({ where: { merchantId: req.merchantId } })`

Pia tutaongeza endpoints mpya za WhatsApp kwa kila merchant:
- `GET /api/whatsapp/status` — Kupata hali ya hewa ya WhatsApp kwa mfanyabiashara huyo.
- `POST /api/whatsapp/connect` — Kuanzisha session na kupata QR code ya duka lake.
- `POST /api/whatsapp/disconnect` — Kufuta session na kujiondoa kwenye simu.

